# Build sources and test harnesses are not needed at runtime. The deployed
# surface is ranksparks.html, the /api routes, and /admin.
#
# NOTE: admin/js and admin/css are deliberately NOT excluded — admin/index.html
# loads them as ES modules, and on a real https origin (unlike file://) that
# works. Excluding them would leave a broken admin page.
work/
uploads/
admin/functions/
admin/firestore.rules.test.mjs
admin/build.py
admin/README.md
PREMIUM-IMPLEMENTATION.md
